This is a personal, non-event fan keepsake inspired by personality, music atmosphere, an imagined scene, daily companionship, or an emotional symbol. Depict portrait-free symbolic memorabilia, a stylized environmental scene, a soft color field, or an original mascot-like emblem. It is not a concert or sports event: no stadium, arena, stage, venue, crowd, audience, performance, or live-show lighting.', '["https://gateway.pinata.cloud/ipfs/bafybeihgkfsd7ym5fzced66nuhgzjgys4rn4zo25wprmijqtq4h4rbp6lm"]', '[{"trait_type":"故事主角","value":"这份喜欢"},{"trait_type":"情感","value":"欣赏与喜欢"}]', 200, 10, 'STABLE', 'ANALYZED', 'forge-v1', '[{"id":"52e78a7f41e702a56f8db163","url":"https://bee-mbr-ab.imglnk.cn/v/54a65920eea246480a168bd6bcadccf9.png","label":"AGENT DRAFT","name":"静默守护","description":"这份 NFT 记录的是：用户指定使用「bigguy」视觉模板，要求制作一张具有闪卡（photocard）质感的粉丝收藏 NFT。核心诉求是基于用户上传的特定参考图进行创作，强调新图必须与参考图在视觉语言、主体特征及氛围上保持高度一致，此前生成的图片因偏离参考图而被否定。当前状态为等待基于参考图的重新生成。。它不补写未发生的演出、现场或共同经历，只保留粉丝亲自表达的欣赏与情绪。","image_prompt":"Create a square portrait-free fan collectible about sincere admiration and personal fandom. The story explicitly centers on 这份喜欢. Translate personality, music atmosphere, imagined scenery, daily companionship, or emotional symbolism into an original emblem, environmental vignette, color field, or abstract memorabilia; do not invent a concert, crowd, ticket, performance, stadium, or event not stated in the story. Do not depict a real person''s face, logo, watermark, or readable text.\n\nThis is a personal, non-event fan keepsake inspired by personality, music atmosphere, an imagined scene, daily companionship, or an emotional symbol. Depict portrait-free symbolic memorabilia, a stylized environmental scene, a soft color field, or an original mascot-like emblem. It is not a concert or sports event: no stadium, arena, stage, venue, crowd, audience, performance, or live-show lighting.","attributes":[{"trait_type":"故事主角","value":"这份喜欢"},{"trait_type":"情感","value":"欣赏与喜欢"}]}]', '52e78a7f41e702a5