ymbol. Depict portrait-free symbolic memorabilia, a stylized environmental scene, a soft color field, or an original mascot-like emblem. It is not a concert or sports event: no stadium, arena, stage, venue, crowd, audience, performance, or live-show lighting.","attributes":[{"trait_type":"故事主角","value":"这份喜欢"},{"trait_type":"情感","value":"欣赏与喜欢"}]}]', 'a5ab85fd630eca02dd884d28', NULL, '2026-08-02T07:56:08.447289', '2026-08-02T07:56:08.447304');
INSERT INTO "nft_forge_sessions" ("id", "user_id", "conversation_id", "template_id", "visual_style", "title", "story_summary", "image_prompt", "reference_image_urls", "suggested_attributes", "supply", "price_fan_tokens", "forge_mode", "status", "rules_version", "generated_versions", "selected_version_id", "published_at", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('05e48243-d172-4d78-96fb-240d987d39bc', '705c9595-ecc7-44cd-82fd-b3e6be27dd65', '07530f3a53724b329109028aceb049bb', 'encore', 'ticket', '回响梦境票根', '用户选择「演唱会纪念票根」作为视觉载体，核心概念为一张超宽幅的超现实梦境艺术海报。画面主体为同一位原创人物的两张巨大侧脸肖像，采用左右镜像、背对背的对称构图，神情平静闭目，象征时间、回忆与自我对话。人物头部连接处爆发出一座繁盛的梦境花园，包含玫瑰、牡丹、雏菊等鲜艳花卉与藤蔓，伴随蝴蝶、飞鸟、星光及记忆碎片向两侧扩散。背景设定为低饱和灰蓝色云层与柔和烟雾，中央辅以银白色逆光光晕，形成黑白人物与彩色花朵的强烈冷暖对比。底部预留立体浮雕质感的标题区域，整体追求华语大型演唱会主视觉的史诗感与印刷级画质，严禁使用艺人真实肖像或可读文字。', 'A hyper-realistic 3D collectible concert ticket stub, horizontal wide format, floating centrally against a soft void with a gentle drop shadow. Left side features a surreal digital collage masterpiece: two mirrored profile faces of an original character facing opposite directions, eyes closed peacefully, rendered in high-contrast black and white photography texture. From the connection point of their heads, an explosive dream garden bursts forth with vibrant red roses, pink peonies, yellow daisies, and lush green vines. Intermingled are colorful butterflies, small birds, glittering confetti ribbons resembling encore streamers, and floating memory fragments. The background consists of low-saturation grey-blue clouds with a hazy silhouette of a distant crowd and a strong silver-white backlight stage glow creating a divine halo effect. The right side is a clean, thick white vertical ticket tag attached by a dashed perforation line, featuring semi-circular notches on the edge. The entire object exhibits a premium thick paper texture with rounded corners, subtle embossing details on the floral elements, and macro-level fiber visibility. Cinematic lighting emphasizing the cold and warm color contrast between the monochrome faces and the vivid garden. 8k resolution, octane render, macro photography details, no text, no logos, no real celebrity faces, no watermarks.', '["https://bee-mbr-ab.imglnk.cn/v/bdd55bd25050f6ba3dd692b710c2f426.webp"]', '[{"trait_type":"Visual Style","value":"Surreal Digital Collage"},{"trait_type":"Core Motif","value":"Mirrored Self-Dialogue"},{"trait_type":"Color Palette","value":"Monochrome & Vibrant Garden"},{"trait_type":"Material Texture","value":"Embossed Thick Paper"},{"trait_type":"Atmosphere","value":"Epic Dream Concert"},{"trait_type":"Rarity","value":"First Edition Stub"}]', 50, 30, 'FOCUSED', 'ANALYZED', 'forge-v1', '[{"id":"0891747095788edf77341e37","url":"https://bee-mbr-ab.imglnk.cn/v/c4f4343241e4fd6017ace50beeca9352.png","label":"AGENT DRAFT","name":"回响梦境票根","description":"本作品以「超宽幅梦境」为核心，将一场宏大的内心演唱会凝结为一张实体化的收藏票根。画面主体由同一原创人物的双生侧脸镜像构成，闭目沉思的姿态象征着时间与自我的深度对话。从头部连接处爆发的繁盛花园，以玫瑰、牡丹与雏菊的绚烂色彩，冲破黑白摄影质感的束缚，寓意记忆碎片在灰蓝云层背景下的重生与绽放。右侧连接的白色穿孔票签，赋予了作品真实的入场仪式感。这不仅是一张 NFT，更是粉丝情感投射的具象载体，记录了那些关于热爱、回忆与无限可能的瞬间，是通往内心史诗世界的唯一凭证。","image_prompt":"A hyper-realistic 3D collectible concert ticket stub, horizontal wide format, floating centrally against a soft void with a gentle drop shadow. Left side features a surreal digital collage masterpiece: two mirrored profile faces of an original character facing opposite directions, eyes closed peacefully, rendered in high-contrast black and white photography texture. From the connection point of their heads, an explosive dream garden bursts forth with vibrant red roses, pink peonies, yellow daisies, and lush green vines. Intermingled are colorful butterflies, small birds, glittering confetti ribbons resembling encore streamers, and floating memory fragments. The background consists of low-saturation grey-blue clouds with a hazy silhouette of a distant crowd and a strong silver-white backlight stage glow creating a divine halo effect. The right side is a clean, thick white vertical ticket tag attached by a dashed perforation line, featuring semi-circular notches on the edge. The entire object exhibits a premium thick paper texture with rounded corners, subtle embossing details on the floral elements, and macro-level fiber visibility. Cinematic lighting emphasizing the cold and warm color contrast between the monochrome faces and the vivid garden. 8k resolution, octane render, macro photography details, no text, no logos, no real celebrity faces, no watermarks.","attributes":[{"trait_type":"Visual Style","value":"Surreal Digital Collage"},{"trait_type":"Core Motif","value":"Mirrored Self-Dialogue"},{"trait_type":"Color Palette","value":"Monochrome & Vibrant Garden"},{"trait_type":"Material Texture","value":"Embossed Thick Paper"},{"trait_type":"Atmosphere","value":"Epic Dream Concert"},{"trait_type":"Rarity","value":"First Edition Stub"}]}]', '0891747095788edf77341e37', NULL, '2026-08-02T08:25:26.361534', '2026-08-02T08:25:26.361552');
INSERT INTO "nft_forge_sessions" ("id", "user_id", "conversation_id", "template_id", "visual_style", "title", "story_summary", "image_prompt", "reference_image_urls", "suggested_attributes", "supply", "price_fan_tokens", "forge_mode", "status", "rules_version", "generated_versions", "selected_version_id", "published_at", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('c92f8e29-2358-41af-8dc2-9e86fc51de0c', '705c9595-ecc7-44cd-82fd-b3e6be27dd65', '07530f3a53724b329109028aceb049bb', 'encore', 'ticket', '回响梦境票根', '用户希望创作一件承载陈奕迅粉丝情感的 NFT 作品，核心意象源于「Fear and Dreams」演唱会的精神内核——关于回忆、梦想与自我对话。视觉形式确定为「演唱会纪念票根」风格。画面不再依赖具体艺人肖像，而是通过「逆光舞台」、「安可彩带」和「人群剪影」来重构现场感。构图强调从观众视角仰望舞台的沉浸感，利用强烈的逆光和漂浮的彩带表现安可环节的高潮与感动。色彩采用低饱和灰蓝背景与高饱和舞台光束的对比，象征平凡生活中的高光时刻。这是一张属于所有在场或心灵在场者的记忆票根，收藏的是那份「无条件」的陪伴与共鸣。', 'IMAGE-TO-IMAGE REVISION. The supplied reference image is the source of truth. Preserve its main subject, scene type, camera angle, composition, horizon, focal point, recognizable visual identity, and successful material details unless the user explicitly asks to replace them. Improve the artwork as a coherent NFT or fan-merch collectible rather than changing to an unrelated concept. Apply the latest story and art-direction change: 故事状态已经成熟或用户已明确要求生成。严格实现当前作品状态，参考图是视觉主体的第一优先级，必须保留可识别的主体族群、重复图案、构图密度、线条语言和配色关系；保留主视觉、构图层级、材质、色彩、光线和粉丝收藏品形态；不要改成无关场景，不要加入 Logo、水印、可读文字或未经授权的真实人物肖像。.

