replace them. Improve the artwork as a coherent NFT or fan-merch collectible rather than changing to an unrelated concept. Apply the latest story and art-direction change: 故事状态已经成熟或用户已明确要求生成。严格实现当前作品状态，参考图是视觉主体的第一优先级，必须保留可识别的主体族群、重复图案、构图密度、线条语言和配色关系；保留主视觉、构图层级、材质、色彩、光线和粉丝收藏品形态；不要改成无关场景，不要加入 Logo、水印、可读文字或未经授权的真实人物肖像。.\n\nBase artwork direction: A horizontal 3D collectible concert ticket stub floating in the center, designed as a premium fan merchandise NFT. Left side features a surreal digital collage: two large mirrored profile silhouettes of a generic human figure facing away from each other, eyes closed in peaceful introspection, rendered in black and white low-saturation photography texture. From the connection point of their heads, a lush dream garden explodes with vibrant red roses, pink peonies, yellow daisies, and green vines, mixing with floating colorful confetti ribbons (encore streamers) and glowing dust particles. The background is a low-saturation grey-blue cloudy sky with a strong, dramatic backlight beam cutting through from a distant stage, illuminating the silhouettes of a cheering crowd below. Right side is a clean white vertical ticket tag with semi-circular perforated edges and dashed tear lines, sho","attributes":[{"trait_type":"情感核心","value":"自我对话与共鸣"},{"trait_type":"视觉意象","value":"镜像侧脸与梦境花园"},{"trait_type":"现场元素","value":"逆光舞台与安可彩带"},{"trait_type":"色彩氛围","value":"灰蓝冷调与繁花暖色"},{"trait_type":"藏品形态","value":"3D 立体穿孔票根"},{"trait_type":"精神主题","value":"Fear and Dreams"}]}]', 'c10db7cb68d1bd48cd1766c2', NULL, '2026-08-02T08:27:56.865051', '2026-08-02T08:27:56.865090');
INSERT INTO "nft_forge_sessions" ("id", "user_id", "conversation_id", "template_id", "visual_style", "title", "story_summary", "image_prompt", "reference_image_urls", "suggested_attributes", "supply", "price_fan_tokens", "forge_mode", "status", "rules_version", "generated_versions", "selected_version_id", "published_at", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('6f8cb8cc-115f-44cc-bfd0-1253630e6fe4', '705c9595-ecc7-44cd-82fd-b3e6be27dd65', '07530f3a53724b329109028aceb049bb', 'encore', 'ticket', '回响梦境票根', '用户选择「演唱会纪念票根」视觉风格，旨在创作一张超现实梦境艺术风格的宽幅海报。核心画面为参考图中人物的两张巨大侧脸肖像，呈左右镜像、背对背对称构图，神情平静闭目，象征回忆、梦想与自我对话。两座头像连接处爆发出一座繁盛的梦境花园，玫瑰、牡丹、雏菊等鲜艳花卉与藤蔓从发丝间生长，伴随蝴蝶、飞鸟、星光与记忆碎片向两侧扩散。背景为低饱和灰蓝云层与柔和逆光，人物采用黑白摄影质感，与彩色花朵形成强烈冷暖对比。底部预留立体浮雕质感的标题区，花瓣穿梭其间。整体追求史诗感、电影级视觉与印刷级画质，严禁使用艺人真实肖像或可读文字，完全基于原创构图与参考图人物特征进行艺术化重构。', 'IMAGE-TO-IMAGE REVISION. The supplied reference image is the source of truth. Preserve its main subject, scene type, camera angle, composition, horizon, focal point, recognizable visual identity, and successful material details unless the user explicitly asks to replace them. Improve the artwork as a coherent NFT or fan-merch collectible rather than changing to an unrelated concept. Apply the latest story and art-direction change: 故事状态已经成熟或用户已明确要求生成。严格实现当前作品状态，参考图是视觉主体的第一优先级，必须保留可识别的主体族群、重复图案、构图密度、线条语言和配色关系；保留主视觉、构图层级、材质、色彩、光线和粉丝收藏品形态；不要改成无关场景，不要加入 Logo、水印、可读文字或未经授权的真实人物肖像。.

Base artwork direction: A horizontal 3D collectible ticket stub floating in mid-air, surreal dream art style. The main body features two large mirrored profile portraits facing opposite directions, eyes closed in serene contemplation, rendered in high-contrast black and white photography texture. Bursting from the connection point of their heads is a lush, vibrant dream garden with red roses, pink peonies, yellow daisies, and green vines growing out of their hair. Colorful butterflies, birds, glittering confetti ribbons (encore atmosphere), and memory fragments float dynamically around the flowers. Silhouettes of a cheering crowd are faintly visible in the lower background against a backlit stage glow. The background consists of low-saturation grey-blue clouds with soft rim lighting and a silver-white halo. Attached to the right side is a vertical white paper ticket tag with semi-circular notches and das', '["https://bee-mbr-ab.imglnk.cn/v/bdd55bd25050f6ba3dd692b710c2f426.webp"]', '[{"trait_type":"Rarity","value":"Encore Edition"},{"trait_type":"Visual Style","value":"Surreal Dream Collage"},{"trait_type":"Core Motif","value":"Mirrored Self-Dialogue"},{"trait_type":"Atmosphere","value":"Backlit Stage & Confetti"},{"trait_type":"Material Finish","value":"Embossed Paper & Holographic Foil"},{"trait_type":"Color Palette","value":"Monochrome Portraits vs. Vibrant Garden"}]', 50, 30, 'FOCUSED', 'ANALYZED', 'forge-v1', '[{"id":"428ab8900ebf8da27a1f0e16","url":"https://bee-mbr-ab.imglnk.cn/v/d7197cdc405355fa8e8cf4149be3386c.png","label":"AGENT DRAFT","name":"回响梦境票根","description":"这是一枚凝结了安可时刻的超现实纪念票根。作品以左右镜像、背对背的闭目侧脸为视觉核心，象征粉丝与自我在音乐中的深度对话；发丝间爆发的繁盛花园与飘散的彩带，将演唱会的热烈氛围转化为永恒的梦境意象。黑白人像与鲜艳花卉的冷暖碰撞，配合右侧真实的半圆缺口与虚线打孔设计，完美融合了史诗级的电影视觉与可触摸的收藏质感，是通往那段星光记忆的唯一凭证。","image_prompt":"IMAGE-TO-IMAGE REVISION. The supplied reference image is the source of truth. Preserve its main subject, scene type, camera angle, composition, horizon, focal point, recognizable visual identity, and successful ma